[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 20881.51, "timestamp": "05:48:01", "text": "还有一条狗。这似乎取决于……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20884.07, "timestamp": "05:48:04", "text": "人和这个人，你知道的。一些"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20887.91, "timestamp": "05:48:07", "text": "人们都很善良，太善良了，嗯，就像……是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20890.07, "timestamp": "05:48:10", "text": "还有其他一些东西。例如，我认为我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20891.83, "timestamp": "05:48:11", "text": "看过一些视频，其中……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20893.83, "timestamp": "05:48:13", "text": "互联网在哪里"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20896.39, "timestamp": "05:48:16", "text": "呃，如果你有，如果你，如果所有者是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20898.628, "timestamp": "05:48:18", "text": "盲人，身体虚弱，需要帮助，求助。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20901.35, "timestamp": "05:48:21", "text": "正确的？它们就像是帮手猫一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20904.07, "timestamp": "05:48:24", "text": "帮手狗狗。太酷了。现在，如果你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20905.23, "timestamp": "05:48:25", "text": "想想"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20908.788, "timestamp": "05:48:28", "text": "是的，他们受过训练。他们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20911.59, "timestamp": "05:48:31", "text": "知道它们的主人是盲人。他们训练"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20914.868, "timestamp": "05:48:34", "text": "并且一定要帮助他们。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20918.19, "timestamp": "05:48:38", "text": "那种东西。所以我觉得就像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20924.07, "timestamp": "05:48:44", "text": "取决于狗狗或者宠物我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20926.59, "timestamp": "05:48:46", "text": "猜猜他们是如何训练的，以及他们如何"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20929.67, "timestamp": "05:48:49", "text": "嗯，他们是如何被抚养长大的，或者像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20933.43, "timestamp": "05:48:53", "text": "我想他们应该挺聪明的。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20935.27, "timestamp": "05:48:55", "text": "如果它们是诚实的狗，那就太有趣了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20936.868, "timestamp": "05:48:56", "text": "他们让自己挨饿。真的。是的。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20937.99, "timestamp": "05:48:57", "text": "是的。我见过这种情况。我见过这种情况。"}]